@host = http://localhost:8000

### Service-to-service — without key (401)
GET {{host}}/ping/service

### Service-to-service — with key
GET {{host}}/ping/service
X-API-Key: local-dev-api-key

### Login (OAuth2 password flow)
# @name login
POST {{host}}/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=ada&password=password123

### Me (uses token from previous request)
GET {{host}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### Scoped endpoint
GET {{host}}/admin/write
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### Login as guest (read-only)
# @name guest
POST {{host}}/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=guest&password=guest

### Guest tries admin/write → 403
GET {{host}}/admin/write
Authorization: Bearer {{guest.response.body.access_token}}
